{ "Identifier":           {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "MMC-CTS-V2.5-I01", "AIMName": "1MMC-CTS-V2.5-I01"},
  "Header":               "MMC-CTS-V2.5",

  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Column Text Selection. Receives the lines of a page as a Text Object (each line a Basic Text Object with its box, in the pixels of the page) and, when the person has pointed, the Point at the top of a column; produces the text of that column as a Basic Text Object: the lines under the point that overlap it horizontally, down to the column's end (a wide gap, a much taller line, or no line left), a word hyphenated across lines joined. With no Point, the first column under the headline.",

